# Overview

To test TPROXY, we need to use Multipass Virtual Machines to avoid messing up the development environment.

But the development environment is WSL2, you need to use `multipass.exe` in WSL2 to interact with the Multipass Virtual Machines in the Windows host.

You can use `multipass.exe transfer` to transfer files to the Multipass Virtual Machines.
